<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In 6 Results ‣ Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">FA-IRL outperforms standard IRL baselines for toxicity reduction across evaluation metrics.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6 Results ‣ Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">FA-IRL yields more faithful rewards and reduces reward ambiguity than standard IRL baselines.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6 Results ‣ Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">FA-IRL improves reward recovery specifically in failure regions where standard IRL struggles.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6 Results ‣ Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">FA-IRL captures subtype-specific alignment signals missed by standard IRL.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6 Results ‣ Learning from Failures: Understanding LLM Alignment through Failure-Aware Inverse RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">FA-IRL rewards enable more effective re-alignment than standard IRL approaches.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
